    <item>
      <title>AptSub Privacy Policy / 隐私政策</title>
      <link>https://yeahohooh.github.io/privacy_aptsub/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://yeahohooh.github.io/privacy_aptsub/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;english&#34;&gt;English&lt;a href=&#34;#english&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&#xA;      stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M15 7h3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 0 1-5-5 5 5 0 0 1 5-5h3&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;      &lt;line x1=&#34;8&#34; y1=&#34;12&#34; x2=&#34;16&#34; y2=&#34;12&#34;&gt;&lt;/line&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective date: October 15, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This Privacy Policy describes how AptSub handles information when you use the app on iPhone, iPad, or Mac.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1-local-processing-and-no-app-account&#34;&gt;1. Local processing and no app account&lt;a href=&#34;#1-local-processing-and-no-app-account&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&#xA;      stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M15 7h3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 0 1-5-5 5 5 0 0 1 5-5h3&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;      &lt;line x1=&#34;8&#34; y1=&#34;12&#34; x2=&#34;16&#34; y2=&#34;12&#34;&gt;&lt;/line&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;AptSub does not require you to create an app account or sign in to use its subtitle tools. Speech recognition uses models bundled with the app and runs on your device. Your videos, extracted audio, subtitle text, and editing projects are not uploaded to the developer or to a cloud recognition service by AptSub.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
